  "id": "slow-cooker-parmesan-chicken-thighs-and-potatoes",
  "name": "Slow Cooker Parmesan Chicken Thighs and Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken and potatoes with herbs, garlic, and Parmesan",
  "description": "Bone-in chicken thighs and seasoned baby potatoes cook together until tender, then finish with Parmesan and parsley.",
